    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1747102920\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1747102920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1747102920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274a Summary \u274a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/9df390ed4b3efd99f24a20e643f6ce00.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erotic events are coming to the righteous knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The son of the lord, a righteous knight George brought his three servants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to a village that was being ravaged by a Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Dungeon only accepts the entrance of  at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having made up his mind, George decided to enter the Dungeon with one of his servants,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but what lies ahead are countless erotic encounters...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduced by a servant or stepped into a trap...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George will encounter various situations in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He may even encounter situations where he has to have sex with enemies...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274a Features \u274a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/f02b7e3922dcc2fdc5cef5fbdfcbc05f.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>\u25bcStory\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story full of myth and conspiracy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that revolves around the Dungeon that appears in a border village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knight George and his three servants will come across powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/955d61cb340fa2fdb668b7d8b2f95c28.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcExploration\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exploration of the Dungeons is executed by simple commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the respective Dungeon of the three servants,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a variety of events are waiting for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/015d06a75b895326cdc4ffba495a0d80.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcCombat\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters occupy the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize each servant's unique skillset and win the battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servants all have multiple armor break presentations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/1d8c9462e5fd2431999917af9cd2f27e.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcBase\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon shop, potion shop, tavern, and inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your base, Jelba Village,\u00a0villagers with rich personalities are waiting for your visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/03b762ffb20f907282253c8416338126.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcCharacters\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knights, Warrior, Dancer, Priest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Dark Knight and their servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 20 characters with illustration are featured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/c4831e433750b7f0f37e903bd9db0e42.avif?t=1747102920\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcH\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring the Dungeon,\u00a0sometimes you can't help but have sex with the servants...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274a Summary of Featuring Characters\u274a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/844070d9fe34d7d5fe60bf31aff13093.avif?t=1747102920\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcThe Knight, George\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the border village, he decided to challenge the Dungeons with his servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn't know his way around females and is a virgin at the start of the story.<br> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/856eec957709356f193671eb62a18df1.avif?t=1747102920\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcThe Warrior, Amelia\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal servant of George.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotionless icy beauty. She is stronger than George.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She hopes to teach George more about how to deal with females.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/b450f1f7c3596f5e8fcf537a54db51b6.avif?t=1747102920\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcDancer Maya\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traveling dancer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was saved by George when she was picked up by gangsters in town. She has been following them since.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is open about sex.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158370/extras/a58327a2c79e087c73c3202b72088a46.avif?t=1747102920\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcPriest Gragina\u25bc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A priest on her pilgrimage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She met George and others when she was ambushed by bandits and joined them ever since.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a serious personality.<br>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274a Game Content\u274a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this RPG game, you play as a righteous knight and explore the Dungeons with your servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the isolated exploration, many erotic events await the knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cA sudden sex during the adventure,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHave sex with trusty comrades,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are the themes of the erotic events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many erotic events are built around these two focal points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exploration of the Dungeons is executed by simple commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 60 basic CGs and over 50 events,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the estimated playtime is about 20 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version contains the prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure the game works on your system environment before buying the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
